<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sk">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Computrax | Renovovaná technika</title>
    <meta name="description"
          content="Computrax – renovované počítače, technika a servis za výhodné ceny.">

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg: #05070a;
            --bg2: #0a0f16;
            --text: #f4f7fb;
            --muted: #8994a3;
            --accent: #00e5ff;
            --accent2: #0066ff;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* BACKGROUND */

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -2;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(0,229,255,.10), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(0,102,255,.12), transparent 35%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #05070a 0%, #080d14 50%, #040609 100%);
        }

        body::after {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: .18;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent);
        }

        /* NAVBAR */

        nav {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 28px 6%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #cbd3dd;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 11px 18px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: white;
            border-color: rgba(0,229,255,.5);
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0,229,255,.12);
        }

        /* HERO */

        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 150px 6% 80px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
            padding: 9px 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.2);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(0,229,255,.05);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .badge::before {
            content: "";
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 105px);
            line-height: .92;
            letter-spacing: -5px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: transparent;
            background: linear-gradient(100deg, #fff, var(--accent));
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 620px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* BUTTON */

        .cta {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 17px 24px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--accent), #1684ff);
            color: #001016;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: .5px;
            box-shadow:
                0 10px 40px rgba(0,229,255,.18),
                inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.4);
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .cta:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow:
                0 18px 55px rgba(0,229,255,.3),
                inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.4);
        }

        .arrow {
            font-size: 20px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .cta:hover .arrow {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        /* DECORATION */

        .orb {
            position: absolute;
            width: 550px;
            height: 550px;
            right: -150px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle,
                    rgba(0,229,255,.16) 0%,
                    rgba(0,102,255,.08) 35%,
                    transparent 68%);
            filter: blur(5px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .tech-card {
            position: absolute;
            right: 8%;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(5deg);
            width: 340px;
            height: 430px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.2);
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                145deg,
                rgba(255,255,255,.07),
                rgba(255,255,255,.015)
            );
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            box-shadow:
                0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.5),
                0 0 70px rgba(0,229,255,.08);
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .card-screen {
            height: 230px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.2);
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,
                    rgba(0,229,255,.25),
                    transparent 35%),
                #050a10;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card-screen::before {
            content: "C";
            font-size: 130px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: rgba(0,229,255,.12);
            text-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0,229,255,.4);
        }

        .card-line {
            height: 8px;
            width: 60%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            margin-top: 22px;
        }

        .card-line.short {
            width: 38%;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        /* FEATURES */

        .features {
            padding: 80px 6% 120px;
        }

        .section-label {
            color: var(--accent);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .features h2 {
            font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 60px);
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 55px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 32px;
            min-height: 220px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .feature:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: rgba(0,229,255,.25);
            background: rgba(0,229,255,.035);
        }

        .icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 13px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: rgba(0,229,255,.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.15);
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .feature p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.65;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* CTA SECTION */

        .final-cta {
            padding: 80px 6% 120px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta-box {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 80px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.15);
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 50% 0%,
                    rgba(0,229,255,.12),
                    transparent 55%
                ),
                rgba(255,255,255,.025);
        }

        .cta-box h2 {
            font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 70px);
            letter-spacing: -3px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .cta-box p {
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: 0 auto 35px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* FOOTER */

        footer {
            padding: 30px 6%;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: #687380;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* MOBILE */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .tech-card,
            .orb {
                display: none;
            }

            .hero {
                padding-top: 140px;
            }

            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            h1 {
                letter-spacing: -3px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                padding: 22px 5%;
            }

            .logo {
                font-size: 19px;
            }

            .nav-link {
                font-size: 11px;
                padding: 9px 13px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 130px 5% 70px;
                min-height: 90vh;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 54px;
                letter-spacing: -3px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .features,
            .final-cta {
                padding-left: 5%;
                padding-right: 5%;
            }

            .cta-box {
                padding: 55px 22px;
            }

            footer {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">COMPUTR<span>AX</span></a>

        <!-- ZMEŇ HREF NA SVOJU STRÁNKU -->
        <a href="https://tvoja-stranka.sk/renovovane-produkty"
           class="nav-link">
            Renovované produkty
        </a>
    </nav>


    <!-- HERO -->
    <main>

        <section class="hero">

            <div class="hero-content">

                <div class="badge">
                    Renovovaná technika
                </div>

                <h1>
                    Technológia<br>
                    <span>za druhú šancu.</span>
                </h1>

                <p>
                    Objavte renovované počítače a techniku od Computrax.
                    Overená funkčnosť, kvalitná starostlivosť a technológia,
                    ktorá nemusí byť nová, aby bola skvelá.
                </p>

                <a href="https://tvoja-stranka.sk/renovovane-produkty"
                   class="cta">
                    POZRIEŤ RENOVOVANÉ PRODUKTY
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                </a>

            </div>

            <div class="orb"></div>

            <div class="tech-card">
                <div class="card-screen"></div>
                <div class="card-line"></div>
                <div class="card-line short"></div>
            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- FEATURES -->
        <section class="features">

            <div class="section-label">
                Prečo Computrax
            </div>

            <h2>
                Viac technológie.<br>
                Menej kompromisov.
            </h2>

            <div class="feature-grid">

                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="icon">↻</div>

                    <h3>Renovované zariadenia</h3>

                    <p>
                        Technika, ktorá dostala druhú šancu.
                        Vyberáme zariadenia s potenciálom na ďalšie roky
                        používania.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="icon">✓</div>

                    <h3>Overená funkčnosť</h3>

                    <p>
                        Zariadenia prechádzajú kontrolou, aby boli
                        pripravené spoľahlivo slúžiť novému majiteľovi.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="icon">⌁</div>

                    <h3>Výhodnejšia technika</h3>

                    <p>
                        Získajte kvalitnú techniku za cenu,
                        ktorá dáva väčší zmysel než kupovať vždy úplne nové.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- FINAL CTA -->
        <section class="final-cta">

            <div class="cta-box">

                <div class="section-label">
                    Computrax
                </div>

                <h2>
                    Daj technike<br>
                    <span>nový život.</span>
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Pozrite si aktuálnu ponuku renovovaných počítačov
                    a techniky.
                </p>

                <a href="https://tvoja-stranka.sk/renovovane-produkty"
                   class="cta">
                    PREJSŤ NA PRODUKTY
                    <span class="arrow">→</span>
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <div>© 2026 COMPUTRAX</div>
        <div>Technológia. Servis. Druhá šanca.</div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
